  "solution": "**Given**\n\n((0.25)⁴ + 2 times (0.25)² + 1 - (0.25)²)/((0.25)² + 0.25 + 1)\n\n**Formula used**\n\na⁴ + a² + 1 = (a² + a + 1)(a² - a + 1)\n\n**Calculation**\n\nLet 0.25 = a,\n\n((0.25)⁴ + 2 times (0.25)² + 1 - (0.25)²)/((0.25)² + 0.25 + 1) = (a4 + a2 + 1)/ (a2 + a + 1) ​= (a2 - a + 1)\n\n⇒ 0.25² - 0.25 + 1\n\n⇒ 1.0625 - 0.25\n\n⇒ 0.8125\n\n**The answer is 0.8125.**",
